    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg: #1a1a2e;\n      --card: #16213e;\n      --accent: #e94560;\n      --text: #eaeaea;\n      --muted: #8a8a9a;\n      --border: #0f3460;\n    }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      background: var(--bg);\n      font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      color: var(--text);\n      padding: 16px;\n    }\n    .card {\n      background: var(--card);\n      border: 4px solid var(--border);\n      box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--accent);\n      padding: 28px 24px;\n      width: 100%;\n      max-width: 360px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 18px;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1.6rem;\n      letter-spacing: 2px;\n      text-align: center;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      color: var(--accent);\n      text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--border);\n    }\n    label {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 6px;\n      font-size: 0.9rem;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    input, select, button {\n      font: inherit;\n      padding: 10px 12px;\n      border: 3px solid var(--border);\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      outline: none;\n      transition: background 0.1s, border-color 0.1s, transform 0.05s;\n    }\n    input:focus, select:focus, button:focus-visible {\n      border-color: var(--accent);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent);\n    }\n    button {\n      cursor: pointer;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 1px;\n      background: var(--accent);\n      color: var(--bg);\n      font-weight: bold;\n      border-color: var(--accent);\n    }\n    button:hover { background: #ff6b81; border-color: #ff6b81; }\n    button:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); box-shadow: none; }\n    #result {\n      min-height: 1.2em;\n      font-size: 1.8rem;\n      text-align: right;\n      padding: 10px 12px;\n      border: 3px solid var(--border);\n      background: var(--bg);\n      color: var(--accent);\n      word-break: break-all;\n    }\n    @media (max-width: 400px) {\n      .card { padding: 20px 16px; gap: 14px; }\n      h1 { font-size: 1.3rem; }\n      body { font-size: 16px; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calc</h1>\n    <label for=\"left\">Left number\n      <input id=\"left\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"e.g. -5\">\n    </label>\n    <label for=\"operation\">Operation\n      <select id=\"operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n      </select>\n    </label>\n    <label for=\"right\">Right number\n      <input id=\"right\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"e.g. 3\">\n    </label>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n    <output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const left = document.getElementById('left');\nconst right = document.getElementById('right');\nconst operation = document.getElementById('operation');\nconst result = document.getElementById('result');\nconst calculateBtn = document.getElementById('calculate');\n\nfunction parseInput(value) {\n  const trimmed = value.trim();\n  if (trimmed === '') return NaN;\n  const num = Number(trimmed);\n  return Number.isFinite(num) ? num : NaN;\n}\n\nfunction compute() {\n  const a = parseInput(left.value);\n  const b = parseInput(right.value);\n  if (Number.isNaN(a) || Number.isNaN(b)) {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  let value;\n  switch (operation.value) {\n    case 'add': value = a + b; break;\n    case 'subtract': value = a - b; break;\n    case 'multiply': value = a * b; break;\n    case 'divide':\n      if (b === 0) { result.textContent = 'Error'; return; }\n      value = a / b;\n      break;\n    default: result.textContent = 'Error'; return;\n  }\n  result.textContent = Number.isFinite(value) ? String(value) : 'Error';\n}\n\ncalculateBtn.addEventListener('click', compute);\n\n[left, right, operation].forEach(el => {\n  el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n    if (e.key === 'Enter') compute();\n  });\n});\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Calculator\n\nA retro pixel-style two-number calculator built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Works fully offline with no packages, storage, or network requests.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a number in **Left number** and **Right number** (negatives supported).\n3. Choose an operation: Add, Subtract, Multiply, or Divide.\n4. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter in any field).\n5. The result appears below; the output shows only the numeric value.\n\n## Features\n\n- Clean pixel-inspired UI with hover, focus, and pressed states.\n- Responsive layout down to 360px wide.\n- Keyboard-accessible labeled controls.\n- Error handling: empty or non-finite inputs and division by zero display exactly `Error`.\n- Initial result is `0`.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — structure and styles.\n- `script.js` — calculation and validation logic.\n- `README.md` — this file.\n\n## Notes\n\nNo external assets, imports, or server code. Open the HTML file directly to use the app.",
